## Why This Is Asked

Assesses a practical NLP baseline and CPU-friendly workflow for ticket routing, including data prep, vectorization, and calibration. Encourages thinking about real data splits and incremental updates, not just accuracy.

## Key Concepts

- Text preprocessing and TF-IDF
- Logistic regression and calibration
- Stratified splits and cross-validation
- Evaluation metrics (F1, ROC-AUC)
- Incremental updates and drift handling

